  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: unhandled HTMLParseError denial of service in HTMLParser\n     when parsing malformed markup declarations\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2025-69534.patch: narrow the marked-section dispatch\n       in parse_html_declaration() in Lib/HTMLParser.py so only \"<![CDATA[\"\n       is routed to parse_marked_section(); any other malformed \"<!...\"\n       construct now falls through to parse_bogus_comment() instead of\n       raising HTMLParseError; also update the test_broken_condcoms\n       expectations to match.\n     - CVE-2025-69534",
